        ".ascii \"def capture_lines(closure, skip=(), path=None, line=0):\\012\"\n"
        ".ascii \"    \\042\\042\\042The lines of gp locals for a func literal's closure object (g++ names it __closure,\\012\"\n"
        ".ascii \"    clang++ this): the variables that the literal captured (g++ also has a local for each one:\\012\"\n"
