        ".ascii \"\\012\"\n"
        ".ascii \"Each goroutine is a thread of the program. The list shows its id, whether it runs or waits (and\\012\"\n"
        ".ascii \"what for: chan receive, chan send, select, ...), its thread and its innermost Go frame. -a also\\012\"\n"
